`,e.jsxs(i.p,{children:["If table structure is known to be stable, this RPC may be unnecessary. ",e.jsx(i.code,{children:"UPDATE_CACHE_FREQUENCY"})," (added in 4.7) lets users define how often the server is checked for metadata/statistics updates. Possible values: ",e.jsx(i.code,{children:"ALWAYS"})," (default), ",e.jsx(i.code,{children:"NEVER"}),", or a millisecond value."]}),`
