`,e.jsxs(i.p,{children:["The Phoenix 1.2 query filter leverages the ",e.jsx(i.a,{href:"https://hbase.apache.org/apidocs/org/apache/hadoop/hbase/filter/SingleColumnValueFilter.html#isFamilyEssential(byte%5B%5D)",children:"HBase Filter Essential Column Family feature"}),". This improves performance when Phoenix filters data split across multiple column families (CFs) by loading only essential CFs first. In a second pass, all CFs are loaded as needed."]}),`
